Third-party components
======================

The source distribution uses the following dependency license families:

- Flutter framework and Flutter plugins — BSD-3-Clause
- Dart SDK packages — BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0
- cupertino_icons, tray_manager, window_manager, screen_retriever, menu_base —
  MIT
- golang.org/x/sys — BSD-3-Clause

The Windows distribution also includes:

- endlessnet-client — Apache-2.0, with its own LICENSE, NOTICE,
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, and SPDX SBOM
- Wintun prebuilt binaries — WireGuard LLC Prebuilt Binaries License

Flutter's generated NOTICES.Z, the client-core compliance files, and the Wintun
prebuilt-binary license are included in the installed application. CI validates
all resolved dependency licenses and rejects unknown or missing license texts.
